{
  "slug": "plugins-codelists-byo",
  "title": "EDItEUR Codelists — bundled default + Bring-Your-Own",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "type": "ingress",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Barkpark ships a bundled EDItEUR "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Issue 73",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " snapshot at "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "api/priv/codelists/onix-issue-73.xml",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " (~1.4 MB), seeded on every boot via "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Barkpark.Codelists.EDItEUR.seed_bundled/0",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": ". Out of the box, a fresh install has Issue 73 codes available."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "License:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " see "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "api/priv/codelists/README.md",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " (CANONICAL). Short form: © EDItEUR, DOI "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "10.4400/nwgj",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": ", internal-use OK, notify-on-redistribute."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Precedence order"
    },
    {
      "id": "b4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "The seeder resolves the XML path by this fixed precedence:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b5",
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "--source PATH",
            "marks": [
              "code"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " argument to "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "mix barkpark.codelists.seed",
            "marks": [
              "code"
            ]
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "BARKPARK_ONIX_CODELIST_PATH",
            "marks": [
              "code"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " env var"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Plugin settings key "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\"codelist_path\"",
            "marks": [
              "code"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " for plugin "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\"onixedit\"",
            "marks": [
              "code"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " (Studio: "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "/studio/:dataset/_plugins/onixedit/settings",
            "marks": [
              "code"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": ")"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Exit-1 policy:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " if none are configured and "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "seed_bundled/0",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " is not wired, the Mix task exits 1 with a guided message — no silent fallback."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Seeding"
    },
    {
      "id": "b8",
      "type": "code",
      "value": "cd api\nmix barkpark.codelists.seed \\\n    --plugin onixedit \\\n    --issue  73 \\\n    --source /var/lib/barkpark/codelists/onix-issue-73.xml"
    },
    {
      "id": "b9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Re-running with the same "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "--issue",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " is "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "idempotent",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " (upserts). A different "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "--issue",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " (e.g. 74) inserts alongside the prior issue — "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Codelists.lookup/3",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " resolves to the latest issue by default."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Thema hierarchy caveat"
    },
    {
      "id": "b11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "ONIX list 93 is "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Supplier role",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " (16 entries), not Thema. Thema is registered under the friendly key "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "onixedit:thema",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "; the alias resolver in "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Barkpark.Content.Codelists",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " ("
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "@external_scheme_friendlies",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": ") bypasses the "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "friendly → list_<N>",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " rewrite that would otherwise mis-route Thema lookups to Supplier role."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "If your Thema snapshot encodes hierarchy by code-prefix instead of explicit "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "<ParentCode>",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": ", run a one-time conversion before seeding — or file an issue for "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "--derive-thema-hierarchy",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " support."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Tests"
    },
    {
      "id": "b14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Synthetic fixture: "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "api/test/fixtures/codelists/synthetic.xml",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " (lists 1, 7, 17, 64 — not production codes). CI runs the parser end-to-end:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b15",
      "type": "code",
      "value": "cd api\nmix test test/barkpark/codelists/editeur_test.exs"
    }
  ],
  "related": []
}